    Main->>Main: load_dotenv()
    Main->>Main: get_xero_duckdb_path()
    Main->>Main: GDRIVE_MOUNT_PATH validation
    Note over Main: Raise if GDRIVE_MOUNT_PATH not set or not exists
    
    Main->>GDriveSync: run_gdrive_sync(root_dir, GDRIVE_PARQUET_DIR)
    
    GDriveSync->>Normalize: normalize_all(mount_path, parquet_dir, skip_rows)
